# Optional: URL of the planner-api service (FastAPI + ENHSP) for /demos/planificacion "Run planner"
# PUBLIC_PLANNER_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765

# Optional: Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (e.g. G-ABC1234XYZ), read at build time.
# Unset, invalid, or this placeholder: no analytics and no consent banner in the build.
# Set: a banner asks first, and nothing loads from Google until a visitor accepts.
# Production takes the value from the GitHub repository variable of the same name.
# See docs/guides/analytics-and-privacy.md.
# PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
